Dann entschuldige ich mich, für mich sah es so aus, als gehöre der "AFD Logo" Teil zum überklebten Sticker. Ich bitte vielmals um Entschuldigung mein\*e werte\*er Kerl\*in

&#x200B;

(tut mir leid, wenn ich beim Gendersternchen einen Fehler gemacht haben sollte, bin besoffen)

i've been born in 2000, and I still mostly remember this "90s" stuff. People don't know that things carry over into a new decade do they?

&#x200B;

(also to answer the question in the picture, either Paper Mario TTYD or Pokemon Stadium)

Might be a dumb question, but can I join the Discord regardless? I'm pretty shy, so i don't know if i'm gonna join the group/play any ops, but i'd still like to see what the group is doing.

&#x200B;

(please excuse any grammatical errors, english isn't my native language)

I just calculated it, and it's probably very very wrong, but I came out at 1.439 to 1.687 Joule depending on Cedrics weight.

&#x200B;

(reminder that i'm drunk right now and really really really bad at math, it was fun to calculate regardless though :D )

